{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18213320","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18213320","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1821332001:0":{"text":"「幼い私は 体が弱く 毎日ママといっしょに 見慣れた道を歩いた」","source_cn":"“儿时的我，体弱多病，每天跟随妈妈走过那条熟悉的路。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B577710AE65CF05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1821332002:0":{"text":"「道の先には お母さんの薬屋さん 扉が開いては閉じて 中の人たちはみんな辛そうだった」","source_cn":"“路的尽头，是妈妈开设的药铺；店门开了又关，里面尽是愁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6604A6AB5C21D6D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1821332003:0":{"text":"「それでもみんなは 私を励ましてくれた 私は『またね』と言った でもなぜか また会えない人もいた……」","source_cn":"“他们的眼中满是风雨，却向小小的我投来鼓励；我学会了与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ADE432FEA02F72B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1821332004:0":{"text":"「ねえママ あのおじいちゃんはどこに行ったの？笑顔が素敵なおばあさんは いつ来るの？」","source_cn":"“妈妈啊，那个爷爷去哪了？那个爱笑的阿姨，怎么再也没来过？”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29676E0FFDE28BCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1821332005:0":{"text":"「ママはそっと私を抱きしめ 夜風に溶けるような声で言った 『別れは時に より素敵な出会いのためにあるのよ』」","source_cn":"“妈妈轻轻抱着我，声音随晚风而去：孩子，有些别离，是为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x620EFCC3FB12FEFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1821332006:0":{"text":"「彼らは嵐を越えて もうお薬のいらない場所に行ったのかもしれない 悩みも何もない場所で 私たちとの再会を待っているかもしれない」","source_cn":"“也许他们走过了风雨，去到一个不用吃药的地方；也许他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CC3DCD782C6E434","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1821332007:0":{"text":"「だから もうお別れは怖くない だって 別れは終わりじゃないってママが言ったから」","source_cn":"“所以我学会了不再害怕再见，因为妈妈说过离别不是终点。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35FD8B829C58A4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1821332008:0":{"text":"「いつか みんな分かるときが来る 別れは時に 素敵な出会いのためにあるのだと」","source_cn":"“总有一天，我们都会明白：有些别离，是为了更好的相聚……”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB68240784341613","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1821332009:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1821332010:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1821332011:1":{"text":"歌が終わり、子どもたちは長いこと、セレネの歌声の余韻に浸っていた。","source_cn":"一曲唱罢，孩子们沉浸在塞涅的歌声中，竟无人回神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F8723977A70B9DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1821332012:1":{"text":"セレネお姉ちゃん、歌がすごく上手だね……","source_cn":"塞……塞涅姐姐唱歌真好听……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0384629B5A03CF8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1821332013:1":{"text":"家に帰りたくなっちゃった……","source_cn":"我，我想家了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9367A383679E91E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1821332014:1":{"text":"別れは、すてきな出会いのためにある……ここで、セレネお姉ちゃんと出会えたみたいに……？","source_cn":"别离是为了更好的相聚……就像，我在这里遇到了塞涅姐姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46E97228FF8C5C4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1821332015:1":{"text":"ブルーノ、あなたは生きている人たちと別れ、亡者の私たちと出会った。ここにいるフレディもリリも、あなたと同じ年齢で死んでしまい、同じように心細かった頃があったのよ。","source_cn":"布鲁诺，你虽与生者告别，却与身为亡者的我们相遇。你身边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883527128E79C5C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18